flowchart LR
    HA["Home Assistant<br/>VM 100"]
    Frigate["Frigate<br/>CT 111"]
    DockerHost["docker-host<br/>VM 103"]
    Immich["Immich<br/>on docker-host"]
    Apps["Mealie / Grocy / LiveSync / GardenKeeper<br/>on docker-host"]
    OMV["OMV NAS<br/>192.168.40.50<br/>NFS/SMB shares"]
    Proxmox["Proxmox host<br/>omv-backups NFS storage"]
    Vault["Project vault<br/>Obsidian repo"]
    Offsite["Future offsite copy<br/>manual or automated"]

    HA -->|"daily HA backups<br/>nas_backups"| OMV
    Frigate -.->|"future recording archive<br/>after camera rollout stabilizes"| OMV
    Immich -->|"library and upload storage"| OMV
    Apps -.->|"planned app-data/dump copy<br/>backups/docker-host"| OMV
    DockerHost -->|"templates and stack configs<br/>Git + app-data plan"| Apps
    Proxmox -->|"VM/CT vzdump backups<br/>7 daily + 6 monthly"| OMV
    Vault -->|"rsync/robocopy backup"| OMV
    OMV -.->|"periodic copy after restore plan exists"| Offsite

    SMART["OMV SMART monitoring<br/>disk health alerts"]
    Restore["Restore drills<br/>HA, Proxmox guests, app data, router configs"]

    OMV --> SMART
    OMV --> Restore
    Proxmox --> Restore
